tribución de madres que han tenido hijos nacidos muertos, filtrando datos completos.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-07-23T09:02:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<ol start=\"13\">\n<li><strong>¿Qué relación hay entre madres con hijos nacidos muertos (hij_nacm &gt; 0) y su edad, etnia o nivel educativo?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Analizamos la distribución de madres que han tenido hijos nacidos muertos, filtrando datos completos.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1753259864413_1055230224","id":"paragraph_1753259864413_1055230224","dateCreated":"2025-07-23T08:37:44+0000","dateStarted":"2025-07-23T09:02:59+0000","dateFinished":"2025-07-23T09:02:59+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false},{"text":"val dfMadresConHijosMuertos = dfNacidosCleanFinal\n  .filter(col(\"hij_nacm\") > 0)\n  .filter(\n    col(\"edad_mad\").isNotNull &&\n    col(\"etnia\").isNotNull &&\n    col(\"niv_inst\").isNotNull &&\n    !lower(col(\"etnia\")).isin(\"sin información\", \"otros\") &&\n    !lower(col(\"niv_inst\")).isin(\"sin información\", \"otros\")\n  )\n  .select(\"edad_mad\", \"etnia\", \"niv_inst\")\n\n//  Edad de las madres \nval dfEdad = dfMadresConHijosMuertos\n  .groupBy(\"edad_mad\")\n  .count()\n  .orderBy(\"edad_mad\")\nz.show(dfEdad)\n\n//  Etnia depurada \nval dfEtnia = dfMadresConHijosMuertos\n  .groupBy(\"etnia\")\n  .count()\n  .orderBy(desc(\"count\"))\nz.show(dfEtnia)\n\n//  Nivel educativo depurado \nval dfNivelEdu = dfMadresConHijosMuertos\n  .groupBy(\"niv_inst\")\n  .count()\n  .orderBy(desc(\"count\"))\nz.show(dfNivelEdu)\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-07-24T09:39:58+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"2":{"graph":{"mode":"pieChart","height":300,"optionOpen":false,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false},"scatterChart":{},"lineChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","forceY":false,"lineWithFocus":false,"isDateFormat":false,"dateFormat":""}},"keys":[{"name":"niv_inst","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[],"values":[{"name":"count","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=112"},{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=113"},{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=114"},{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=115"},{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=116"},{"jobUrl":"http://10.0.5.2:4040/jobs/job?id=117"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1753349849225_2088139528","id":"paragraph_1753349849225_2088139528","dateCreated":"2025-07-24T09:37:29+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-07-24T09:37:41+0000","dateStarted":"2025-07-24T09:37:37+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"edad_mad\tcount\n13\t2\n15\t4\n16\t16\n17\t25\n18\t45\n19\t71\n20\t92\n21\t108\n22\t158\n23\t179\n24\t151\n25\t197\n26\t239\n27\t224\n28\t214\n29\t232\n30\t223\n31\t205\n32\t215\n33\t205\n34\t184\n35\t199\n36\t181\n37\t135\n38\t134\n39\t126\n40\t91\n41\t61\n42\t51\n43\t32\n44\t14\n45\t8\n46\t5\n47\t3\n48\t2\n50\t1\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"etnia\tcount\nMestiza\t3506\nIndígena\t320\nAfroecuatoriana/Afrodescendiente\t67\nNegra\t57\nMontubia\t38\nOtra\t18\nBlanca\t15\nMulata\t11\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"niv_inst\tcount\nEducación Básica\t1863\